    "text": "<p>Given,</p><p>Function&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mi>x</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>,</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"\" open=\"{\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mfrac><mrow><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mfrac><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;and&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mi>f</mi><mfenced><mi>x</mi></mfenced></math></p><p>To find&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></munder><mi>g</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>h</mi><mfenced><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Taking&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>.</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">L</mi></math>,&nbsp;we take&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>h</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><munder><mi>lim</mi><mrow><mi>h</mi><mo>&#8594;</mo><msup><mn>0</mn><mo>-</mo></msup></mrow></munder><mi>g</mi><mo>(</mo><mi>h</mi><mo>(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo